{
  "title": {
    "zh": "看不见的手"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "现在把调价器放到街上。街上的需求它一个数也读不到，每天只看得到昨天的价格、剩下的和没买到的。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "没有人告诉它出清价格是多少，它一天天调，自己走到了那里；行情变了，它又跟过去。这种一步步试出来的办法叫<wiki-ref to=\"tatonnement\"></wiki-ref>。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "street",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "每条街开张 30 天。最后一天，剩下的和没买到的都要不到 1。"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "was",
          "label": {
            "zh": "昨天的价格"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "left",
          "label": {
            "zh": "剩下"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "short",
          "label": {
            "zh": "没买到"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "price",
          "label": {
            "zh": "价格"
          },
          "view": "dots"
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 20,
              "top": 60,
              "slope": 2,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        },
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 15,
              "top": 105,
              "slope": 3,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        },
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 12,
              "top": 40,
              "slope": 4,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 20,
              "top": 47,
              "slope": 2,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        },
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 30,
              "top": 78,
              "slope": 4,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        },
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 10,
              "top": 60,
              "slope": 1,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 60
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "a = pricer(was, left, short)",
        "price <- a"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "price <- was"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shift",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "两家店各定各的价，行情中途会变。60 天后，两家都要出清。"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "was1",
          "label": {
            "zh": "甲店昨天的价格"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "left1",
          "label": {
            "zh": "甲店剩下"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "short1",
          "label": {
            "zh": "甲店没买到"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "was2",
          "label": {
            "zh": "乙店昨天的价格"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "left2",
          "label": {
            "zh": "乙店剩下"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "short2",
          "label": {
            "zh": "乙店没买到"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "price1",
          "label": {
            "zh": "甲店价格"
          },
          "view": "dots"
        },
        {
          "name": "price2",
          "label": {
            "zh": "乙店价格"
          },
          "view": "dots"
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 20,
              "top": 60,
              "slope": 2,
              "open": 10,
              "shifts": [
                {
                  "at": 20,
                  "top": 80
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stock": 15,
              "top": 105,
              "slope": 3,
              "open": 10,
              "shifts": [
                {
                  "at": 30,
                  "top": 75
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 60
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 30,
              "top": 78,
              "slope": 4,
              "open": 10,
              "shifts": [
                {
                  "at": 15,
                  "top": 110
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stock": 10,
              "top": 60,
              "slope": 1,
              "open": 10,
              "shifts": [
                {
                  "at": 25,
                  "top": 40
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 60
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "a = pricer(was1, left1, short1)",
        "b = pricer(was2, left2, short2)",
        "price1 <- a",
        "price2 <- b"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "price1 <- was1",
        "price2 <- was2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "catch",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "三块别人搭的调价器，各错一处。写两行检验：每行给出昨天的价格、剩下、没买到，和对的调价器该给的价格。对的要两行都过，三块错的每块至少被一行挡住。"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "was",
          "label": {
            "zh": "昨天的价格"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "left",
          "label": {
            "zh": "剩下"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "short",
          "label": {
            "zh": "没买到"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "price",
          "label": {
            "zh": "今天的价格"
          }
        }
      ],
      "works": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh": "甲"
          },
          "board": [
            "k = const[value=0.25]()",
            "d = mul(short, k)",
            "n = add(was, d)",
            "price <- n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "zh": "乙"
          },
          "board": [
            "g = sub(left, short)",
            "k = const[value=0.25]()",
            "d = mul(g, k)",
            "n = add(was, d)",
            "price <- n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "zh": "丙"
          },
          "board": [
            "g = sub(short, left)",
            "k = const[value=0.5]()",
            "d = mul(g, k)",
            "n = add(was, d)",
            "price <- n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "in": {
            "was": 10,
            "left": 0,
            "short": 20
          },
          "out": {
            "price": 15
          }
        },
        {
          "in": {
            "was": 20,
            "left": 8,
            "short": 0
          },
          "out": {
            "price": 18
          }
        }
      ],
      "withhold": [
        "pricer",
        "demand",
        "min",
        "div"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "g = sub(short, left)",
        "k = const[value=0.25]()",
        "d = mul(g, k)",
        "n = add(was, d)",
        "price <- n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mend",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "别人搭的调价器，有的街上它一直卖不完。看它在哪条街上出错，只许再添一块元件，把它修好。"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "was",
          "label": {
            "zh": "昨天的价格"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "left",
          "label": {
            "zh": "剩下"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "short",
          "label": {
            "zh": "没买到"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "price",
          "label": {
            "zh": "价格"
          },
          "view": "dots"
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 20,
              "top": 30,
              "slope": 2,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        },
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 20,
              "top": 60,
              "slope": 2,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 15,
              "top": 40,
              "slope": 3,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        },
        {
          "shops": [
            {
              "stock": 30,
              "top": 78,
              "slope": 4,
              "open": 10
            }
          ],
          "ticks": 30
        }
      ],
      "withhold": [
        "pricer",
        "demand",
        "min",
        "div"
      ],
      "most": 4,
      "starter": [
        "k = const[value=0.25]()",
        "d = mul(short, k)",
        "n = add(was, d)",
        "price <- n"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "g = sub(short, left)",
        "k = const[value=0.25]()",
        "d = mul(g, k)",
        "n = add(was, d)",
        "price <- n"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "k = const[value=0.25]()",
        "d = mul(short, k)",
        "n = add(was, d)",
        "price <- n"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
